      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762756016052,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n\n- session = 1 iteration of an agent run\n- sessions and jobs are 1:1\n- assignments = collection of jobs for 1 PR\n- 1 PR = 1 assignment which can have\nmultiple sessions (jobs)\n- workflow = Actions workflow that is the\ncompute environment for the agent\nruntime",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "w5Ll52yazrztoBJGlDG-8",
      "originalText": "\n\n\n- session = 1 iteration of an agent run\n- sessions and jobs are 1:1\n- assignments = collection of jobs for 1 PR\n- 1 PR = 1 assignment which can have multiple sessions (jobs)\n- workflow = Actions workflow that is the compute environment for the agent runtime",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
